      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "It would be nice, having the option to either disable, or limit the amount of particles (maybe a slider like Second Life for limiting particles?). Because I think particles in moderation don't typically lag (even on my toaster laptop in VR which doesn't pass the Steam VR benchmark and lags at mirrors), and can add to the experience of worlds, so it'd be a shame if people completely turned it off just to avoid excessive particles or griefers, and then can't see things like rain or snow in a world.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
